n that unblocks a `blocked` item or a new `human_pending`); only the human ever closes a `human_pending`, through `cepa-plan responde`, which refuses without a terminal. Refuses a `parallel-waves` plan — that one is `/maestro:run`'s. See [execution-plan.md](execution-plan.md). |\n3:  \"version\": \"2.26.5\",","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011zLAQm63o4qaHDkrWxGZHP","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
